The near-matched aspect-ratio preprocessing in preprocessing.py is adapted
from the full-target-grid branch of _fit_encode_image in ComfyUI-Krea2Edit:
https://github.com/lbouaraba/comfyui-krea2edit
Source: https://github.com/lbouaraba/comfyui-krea2edit/blob/main/__init__.py
Upstream is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The adaptation adds input validation, restricts unsupported geometry, and
stores the raw VAE result in a portable target-specific safetensors file.

This independent compatibility project works with Krea 2 and Krea2 Identity
Edit through ComfyUI-Krea2Edit's existing nodes. It does not imply endorsement
by their authors. No Krea 2, Identity Edit LoRA, or Qwen model weights are
included or redistributed.
